{"id":"da74a4922b7a5745","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification.md","title":"固定点真值剖面有七种非空类型","display":"prop-paradox-sentence-classification — 固定点真值剖面有七种非空类型","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification","aliases":["91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification","91-prop-paradox-classification"],"display":"prop-paradox-sentence-classification — 固定点真值剖面有七种非空类型","depends_on":["[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","[[91-df-unstable-sentence]]","[[91-df-truth-teller]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification</span><span>91-prop-paradox-classification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-paradox-sentence-classification — 固定点真值剖面有七种非空类型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b350e567d372da0\" href=\"?note=6b350e567d372da0\" title=\"91-df-unstable-sentence\">91-df-unstable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"724d38bcb2abeb43\" href=\"?note=724d38bcb2abeb43\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller\">91-df-truth-teller</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span> (非空的一致固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (句子在固定点中的强 Kleene 值)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\equiv\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\equiv\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\\)</span> (固定点真值剖面)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\,\n\\left[\n\\varnothing\\neq\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\,\n\\left[\n\\varnothing\\neq\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此可能的剖面恰落在三元集合的七个非空子集中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单元素剖面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf t\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf t\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf f\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf f\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> 分别表示\n稳定真、稳定假、稳定 gap；其余四种剖面都表示某种固定点依赖性，不能\n全部压缩成一个没有内部区分的“不稳定”类别。</p>\n<p>在标准一致强 Kleene 固定点中，说谎者的剖面是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span>；\n真理陈述者可有真、假或 gap，剖面为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span>。分类依赖所量化的固定点类；若\n允许 glut，还要扩充真值集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-unstable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"6b350e567d372da0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-unstable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-teller","status":"resolved","id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\equiv\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\,\n\\left[\n\\varnothing\\neq\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1599,"backlinks":[{"id":"525f810b84880b72","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3a19d5715745463a","6b350e567d372da0","724d38bcb2abeb43"]}